{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A RETRO-STYLE CLASSIC ARCADE RACING GAME!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the pedal to the metal in fast, top-down 2D races packed with tight corners and classic power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Racers sets the pace for retro-style, 2D top-down arcade racing. Weave past opponents, chase clean lines, and unlock 12 exciting tracks. Grab four classic power-ups\u2014Acceleration, Top Speed, Nitro Boosts, and Traction\u2014then stay sharp through oil slicks and time the opening and closing gates to slip through shortcuts without losing momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 exciting tracks to race and unlock</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 classic power-ups: Acceleration, Top Speed, Nitro Boosts, and Traction</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gates that open and close for tactical shortcuts</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oil slick hazards to avoid</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HD visuals at 60 FPS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down 2D arcade racing action</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for quick races and repeat runs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad support</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to Race? 3... 2... 1... GO Play Retro Racers Now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2182920?t=1770996999","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182920/2271500b498ac972760746a200fb3c144dd5016e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770996999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182920/1ba38218a3ada5602f5ca757d54fc98503e68